{"step_index":1599,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T23:18:26Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-25T18:18:26-05:00\nPartial read (lines 1-157 of 157). Showing bytes 0-46080 of 85075 in this line range, truncated at the 46080-byte limit. To read the rest of this line range, call this tool again with the same StartLine and EndLine and ByteOffset=46080.\n1: Created At: 2026-11-25T18:18:22-05:00\n2: Completed At: 2026-11-25T18:18:23-05:00\n3: Command exited with code 0.\n4: \n5: Command output:\n6: === work/text/table_0019be000.json entries: 36888\r\n7:   TEXT HIT: 01344a10 'Body armor is sold at Ammu-Nations ~BLIP_STYLE_STORE_GUN~ While equipped, your health is protected from ~b~gunshots~b~ or ~b~explosive damage~b~ until it fully breaks.~n~~n~To manage body armor on the move, hold ~INPUT_OPEN_WHEEL_MENU~ and press ~INPUT_SELECT_NEXT_WHEEL~ to access it. Select the armor and press ~INPUT_HUD_QUICK_SELECT_QUICK_USE_RDOWN~ to equip or unequip it.~n~~n~~b~Tip:~b~ You can store extra body armor in your trunk ~BLIP_STYLE_PERSONAL_VEHICLE~ when purchasing it at Ammu-Nations.'\r\n8:   TEXT HIT: 024e0e25 'So bad news. The Ganado ended up getting totaled.'\r\n9:   TEXT HIT: 02a01b29 \"Powerful revolver with a subtle patriotic design, purchased at Phil's Ammu-Nation in Southside.\"\r\n10:   TEXT HIT: 03da4607 'Gone Fishing'\r\n11:   TEXT HIT: 03f726c6 'Call Joey from your ~b~Contacts ~BLIP_APP_CONTACTS~~b~ or check the engine to tow and repair your vehicle.'\r\n12:   TEXT HIT: 0419f84f '@frickjoey'\r\n13:   TEXT HIT: 048935d2 \"Phil's Ammu-Nation\"\r\n14:   TEXT HIT: 06bf12a2 'Free new styles are available at any salon ~1b~ and a weapon wrap is available at any Ammu-Nation ~2b~'\r\n15:   TEXT HIT: 0e76b2c9 'Ammu-Nation distributor that stocks guns, mods, ammo, and equipment.'\r\n16:   TEXT HIT: 10356152 \"Working for Brian will require some gear from Ammu-Nation. Pick up a longarm at Chuck's Tackle & Shot.\"\r\n17:   TEXT HIT: 11a59fbe 'Liberty, Gellhorn, Alderney and Carcer had parachuted down into occupied Europe — \n<truncated 42377 bytes>\ny before whoever torched the house tracks him down.'}, 'CLB_DEAL': {'CLB_DEAL': \"Dealer's Choice\", 'PROG_CLB_DEAL_DESC_REPLAY': \"Boobie says Jason owes him a favor for letting him and Lucia stay in his apartment, so sends him on a drug deal. Dre'Quan comes as backup while Jason picks up some coke from local dealer, Tyrone, then sells it in Crosstown. Back at the apartment, Cal arrives and tries to break into the hardrive but fails. He tells Jason and Lucia that Brian used to have a highly capable VC contact who may be able to help them.\", 'CLB_DEAL_DESC': 'Boobie gave you a place to stay, but you owe him something in return.'}, 'CLB_EVI': {'CLB_EVI': 'Fresh Evidence', 'PROG_CLB_EVI_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Dre'Quan inflitrate Dante Fresh's mansion and steal the blackmail material he has on Royce Jones. They meet with Royce's assistant, Briana, who says the Dimez will headline VYB's reopening launch party soon.\", 'CLB_EVI_DESC': \"Break into Dante's mansion and steal his private tapes.\"}, 'CLB_HELI': {'CLB_HELI': 'Photo/Shoot', 'PROG_CLB_HELI_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia help Dre'Quan do a photo shoot for the Dimez with a helicopter at the top of a skyscraper. Dre'Quan heads down to the lobby to meet a club promoter called KD, where he is ambushed and kidnapped by Cash City. Jason, Lucia, and the Dimez rescue him. KD promises Dre'Quan a meet with club promoter Royce Jones to make up for it.\", 'CLB_HELI_DESC': \"Help Dre'Quan shoot some promo material for the Dimez.\"}, 'CLB_MEET': {'CLB_MEET': 'Welcome to Vice City', 'PROG_CLB_MEET_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Lucia meet Jason's friend, Dre'Quan, at Jack of Hearts - the strip club where he runs a record label in Crosstown, Vice City. Dre'Quan introduces them to his boss, Boobie Ike. Boobie says they're welcome to stay in his apartment nearby. They settle into their new home.\", 'CLB_MEET_DESC': \"Dre'Quan is at the Jack of Hearts. He should have a place nearby where you can lay low.\"}, 'CLB_PARTY': {'CLB_PARTY': 'Headliners', 'PROG_CLB_PARTY_DESC_REPLAY': \"Jason and Luci","truncated_fields":["content"]}
